{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["And Yosef could no longer restrain himself — for until now he had done all his deeds by restraining himself in his heart, as stated above: ״ויתאפק ויאמר שימו לחם״." "Before all who stood by him — in the presence of all who stood by him, and he could no longer restrain himself." "And he called — to his attendants." "Cause every man to go out — those who stood by him, from the house. Such is the essence of its plain sense."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:16.072892608Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}